{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-03_end","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-03","title":"鳴銃示警","storyCode":"10-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"b59956ee726962a482c221d5a52cfae0be79c4fdfd5789629d4628f822973603","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！升降梯倒了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再往下一點點，我、我的腿就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉住我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說拉住我的造物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笨蛋......你別把我也拽倒了啊！帶著你們，我本來就很難浮起來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長、長官......謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下回滾得更機靈些，少給我添亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......是炮彈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，要比一般的榴彈炮厲害得多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且，僅僅瞄準了這一小塊區域？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德......你是不是早就在看著了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死的心機深沉的魔族佬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好了，都給我停止行動！這些薩卡茲沒有追的必要了，至於那個司機......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒楣地方......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，這、這是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城防炮怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......倫蒂尼姆的防禦牆建成近七十年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是第一次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牆上的防禦炮，瞄準目標包含了......城內。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威力不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只用上了一成火力，就能輕鬆熔毀普通結構。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這可是倫蒂尼姆的城防武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還只是副炮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的武器專家說，如果我能啟動主炮，這些炮能輕鬆擊穿任意一艘高速戰艦的裝甲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武器專家......是那位城防軍工兵隊的軍官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧你幫我抓到了他和他的妻女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他還活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲還用得上他，他就不會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮手，瞄準十一號升降梯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......偏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，準度還需要提升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟這些炮口原本只能對外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對外......在我們進入倫蒂尼姆之前，這些城防炮瞄準的是城外大公爵的軍隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我們假借平息公爵爭端的名義入城的時候，它們甚至都沒有把我們的人納入過瞄準範圍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也算對外嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從高盧戰敗、伊比利亞沉寂之後，維多利亞已很久不需要應對實質上的外敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，所以殿下為我們謀到了這個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此精良的武器，本就該發揮更大作用，而不是架在這裡，充當點綴門楣的裝飾品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮手，啟動活動目標動態追蹤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給它們調整朝向就耗費了我們整整一個月的時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所幸效果基本達標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制住了這批武器，就意味著我們真正控制住了倫蒂尼姆的出入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們把所有城防炮都調整好......就再沒有人能躲在鋼鐵高牆的蔭蔽之下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮火似乎被深池引開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......一次試驗？他們的目的難道僅僅只是驗證......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他們真正的目標並不是這出入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中尉，我們怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......繼續往城內方向撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......薩迪恩區的其他地方也不再安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲對倫蒂尼姆的控制正在收緊。只要城防炮對準城內一天，我們的性命就隨時都捏在他們手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民？","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在想什麼，中尉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。走吧，先離開這裡再說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g2_inexport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這該死的城牆，該死的炮！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，您的造物又被擊碎了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我根本......來不及！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別愣著了，滾，有多快滾多快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......逼著我們從這裡逃跑是吧？曼弗雷德，你今天這麼戲耍我，我早晚都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我剛才看到有個熟悉的人影朝相反方向跑了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人......褐色頭髮的魯珀？是她？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我攔下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，小心！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_406_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我擋著，您快走，快走吧......您還要替領袖......找......找到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是第十三個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十三條塔拉人的命。我會替領袖記住，有朝一日，我要親手、成倍地問薩卡茲討回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，深池的隊伍完全被打散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們沒注意到反抗軍......這幫狡猾的蟲豸！他們好像就露了一下頭，城防炮啟動以後，就又不見了蹤影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，他們會不會已經被打死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我就覺得我們的工作不至於這麼輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他們是混進逃走的人群裡了嗎？要不要通知巡邏隊，讓他們攔住平民，繼續搜捕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續炮轟出入口。對了，加大力度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加大火力？出入口已經爛得差不多了，不太可能藏人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不會再走這條路了。而且，你見過薩卡茲拔刀只拔一半的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然動了手，不如讓他們看看清楚，我們能做到什麼程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是故意在他們面前彰顯力量。你想......斷了他們的後路，逼他們自己走出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這場捉迷藏耗時夠久了。即便我還能等，殿下們與諸王庭也都已失去耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論是誰，有所圖謀的話，我只想麻煩他們快一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，附近沒有一處位置是絕對安全的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我們全部撤到了這塊結構下面，也還是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也還是隨時都會被這個炮打穿啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我粗略估計過了，別說我們頭頂這塊外牆底板，這炮要是火力全開的話，就連正式的移動城市地塊也能擊穿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，你們倫蒂尼姆的炮真不是開玩笑啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這也是我第一次見它們大規模啟動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們受到的歡迎還挺有規格囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"規格再提升的話，我們會在距城牆五十公里處灰飛煙滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊要撐不住了啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我的無人機也加固不了這底板結構了，照這麼轟下去，我們早晚一起被炸飛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池士兵也在用最快的速度撤退......但他們用上了法術造物做掩體，還會丟下受傷的士兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......啊......為什麼我們這麼倒楣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是我們都會死在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能丟下這些倫蒂尼姆市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偵察小組，你們看到炮手了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們恐怕找不到炮手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆的城防炮，與我們面前的高牆，本來就是一體的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也就是說，如果我們沒法登上高牆或者進入高牆內部，就不可能停止這場轟炸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒人能頂著炮轟登牆。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們找不到進入城牆內部的途徑。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在這等死也不是辦法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，我出去引開這炮火？以我的本事，至少能堅持個幾分鐘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她一個不行的話，我們一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們別添亂了好不好？達格達，你是不是跟因陀羅混久了，腦子裡也都只剩下肌肉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是讓人出去當誘餌是可行的，哪裡輪得到你們倆在這裡爭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們拿的防具，最多挨兩下正規軍的弩箭，這已經是工程部的朋友們努力了幾個月的成果了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這麼急著去送死的話，就壓根不該跟來倫蒂尼姆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我聽你的，但我絕對不會讓維娜在這裡出事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們甚至......連家門都還沒進！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你們出去確實沒用。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"還沒到說這些話的時候。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你是不是有想法了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"無人機。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機......哦哦，我懂了......我說嘛，果然是這個邏輯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼啊可露希爾？博士話是少，但你不要說了跟沒說一個樣子啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啊，我在想方案呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這防禦炮還挺智慧的，射程範圍這麼大，它不可能完全依靠手動瞄準，所以它肯定會以某種方式鎖定地面附近的活動目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一兩個人出去是沒辦法讓炮火從我們頭頂移開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果我的無人機全部出動，對瞄準演算法來說，威脅性說不定能超過我們小隊加上所有平民......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是說不定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰也沒法保證啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，加固失敗，超出無人機承壓閾值！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不出三十秒，這底板一定會塌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只能試試看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等博士指示，全員做好撤出準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五、四、三——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"走！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機發射！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家快跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......成功了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是這一小會，讓我們轉移到了沒幾步遠的這地方......這塊結構同樣支撐不了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且沒有下一次機會了啊，我的寶貝無人機全被打爛了，就算是我，也沒法原地給你們再變一批出來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往前往後都不算安全，想逃出轟炸區，我們還是要冒很大的險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能有一條讓我們繞開這裡的路就好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你們在找路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰在這裡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯小姐，我想和你們談一談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在此之前，你最好讓你的手下把武器都從我身上移開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自我介紹得稍後再說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鋼爪，砍刀，還有這位......呃，這位手上的錘子？女士，你的武器看起來非常帥，但能不能不要對著我的腦袋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的話，你們的這位朋友可能會有生命危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"啊？發生了什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"他說的是我？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰都別靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有人走近一步，這位朋友的後腦勺就會原地爆開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿、阿米婭，是無人機......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一架無人機，趁我們大家不注意，偷偷繞了過去，現在正貼在博士後腦勺上啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尖耳朵的女士，你很識貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實話說，我對你們真的越來越好奇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家，放下武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這才對嘛。不過別忘記撤掉角落裡那些弩。我敢打賭，自從我站到你們面前，你們的狙擊手就沒眨過眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......照他說的做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你相信我，我們從來不會主動地給任何陌生人造成傷害。但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但凡你敢傷害你面前的人，請同樣相信我，我可以不依賴任何武器，現在，立刻，讓你永遠失去威脅別人的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......這地方已經夠危險了，動手之前我們可能都會被炸死啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，要是不想一起被薩卡茲炸成禮花的話，我們恐怕沒時間站在這裡互相指腦袋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我有個建議，請你們放棄抵抗，跟我走一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在到地方之前，你們這位朋友還是借我一用——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不好吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我能拒絕嗎？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，你暫時沒有選擇的權利。請乖乖跟我走吧，看不見臉的朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
